{"id": "f1fbc80c-acbd-400c-8981-bf9d33033056", "slug": "retro-diamonds-1", "title": "Retro Diamonds", "description": "Retro Diamonds Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Retro Diamonds\"\ndescription: \"Retro Diamonds Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#64B4FF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#64B4FF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#151515\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#A0A0A0\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Retro Diamonds\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 108; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nRetro Diamonds Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nレトロ ダイヤモンド Retro Diamonds / 003\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #64B4FF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #64B4FF, background #FFFFFF, surface #151515, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse ui-sans-serif for display moments and ui-sans-serif for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Retro Diamonds</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-neutral-950 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 antialiased text-white\">\n\n  <div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9; background: linear-gradient(180deg,#151515 0%,#050505 100%); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset, 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.8);\">\n\n    <!-- Gradient border overlay -->\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl z-20\" style=\"padding:1px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.15),rgba(0,0,0,.2)); -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite:xor; mask-composite:exclude;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Flashlights -->\n    <div id=\"fl1\" class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[50vw] h-[50vw] rounded-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%); filter: blur(40px);\"></div>\n    <div id=\"fl2\" class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-[60vw] h-[60vw] rounded-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(100,180,255,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%); filter: blur(50px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Giant text backdrop -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center pointer-events-none select-none z-0 anim-parent\">\n      <div class=\"text-[clamp(3rem,9vw,9rem)] font-black tracking-tighter text-white/5 flex items-center justify-center gap-[clamp(0.5rem,2vw,2rem)]\">\n        <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); filter:blur(12px); transition:all 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">レトロ</span>\n        <span class=\"whitespace-pre\"> </span>\n        <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); filter:blur(12px); transition:all 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">ダイヤモンド</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL / canvas scene -->\n    <canvas id=\"scene\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block z-10\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Header card -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-5 left-5 sm:top-7 sm:left-7 anim-parent z-30\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900/80 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2.5 pr-5\" style=\"box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.1) inset, 0 8px 24px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.6); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\">\n        <span class=\"anim-el grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 text-white\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); filter:blur(4px); transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"stroke-width:1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); filter:blur(4px); transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">Retro</span>\n          <span class=\"whitespace-pre\"> </span>\n          <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); filter:blur(4px); transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">Diamonds</span>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 tracking-widest font-mono pl-2 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); filter:blur(4px); transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">/</span>\n          <span class=\"whitespace-pre\"> </span>\n          <span class=\"anim-el inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); filter:blur(4px); transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">003</span>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // ---- In-view reveal (Element by Element, Word by Word) ----\n    const animParents = document.querySelectorAll('.anim-parent');\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((e) => {\n      e.forEach(en => { \n        if(en.isIntersecting) {\n          const els = en.target.querySelectorAll('.anim-el');\n          els.forEach((el, i) => {\n            setTimeout(() => {\n              el.style.opacity = '1'; \n              el.style.transform = 'translateY(0)'; \n              el.style.filter = 'blur(0)';\n            }, i * 120);\n          });\n          io.unobserve(en.target);\n        }\n      });\n    }, {threshold: .2});\n    animParents.forEach(p => io.observe(p));\n\n    // ---- Canvas isometric scene ----\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('scene');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    let W, H, DPR;\n\n    function resize(){\n      DPR = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1, 2);\n      const r = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n      W = r.width; H = r.height;\n      canvas.width = W*DPR; canvas.height = H*DPR;\n      ctx.setTransform(DPR,0,0,DPR,0,0);\n    }\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n    resize();\n\n    function iso(x,y,z, scale, ox, oy){\n      return {\n        x: ox + (x - y) * scale * 0.866,\n        y: oy + (x + y) * scale * 0.5 - z * scale\n      };\n    }\n\n    // Animated sliding lattice\n    function drawLattice(scale, ox, oy, t){\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n      const N = 18;\n      const offset = (t * 2.5) % 1;\n      for(let i=-6;i<=N;i++){\n        let idx = i + offset;\n        let a = iso(idx,-6,0,scale,ox,oy), b = iso(idx,N,0,scale,ox,oy);\n        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(a.x,a.y); ctx.lineTo(b.x,b.y); ctx.stroke();\n        let c = iso(-6,idx,0,scale,ox,oy), d = iso(N,idx,0,scale,ox,oy);\n        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(c.x,c.y); ctx.lineTo(d.x,d.y); ctx.stroke();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function block(gx,gy,h,scale,ox,oy){\n      const top = [iso(gx,gy,h,scale,ox,oy),iso(gx+1,gy,h,scale,ox,oy),iso(gx+1,gy+1,h,scale,ox,oy),iso(gx,gy+1,h,scale,ox,oy)];\n      ctx.fillStyle='rgba(30,30,30,0.95)';\n      poly(top); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'; poly(top); ctx.stroke();\n      \n      const left=[top[3],top[2],iso(gx+1,gy+1,0,scale,ox,oy),iso(gx,gy+1,0,scale,ox,oy)];\n      ctx.fillStyle='rgba(20,20,20,0.95)'; poly(left); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'; poly(left); ctx.stroke();\n      \n      const right=[top[1],top[2],iso(gx+1,gy+1,0,scale,ox,oy),iso(gx+1,gy,0,scale,ox,oy)];\n      ctx.fillStyle='rgba(10,10,10,0.95)'; poly(right); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.05)'; poly(right); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n    function poly(pts){ ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(pts[0].x,pts[0].y); for(let i=1;i<pts.length;i++)ctx.lineTo(pts[i].x,pts[i].y); ctx.closePath(); }\n\n    function drawDiamond(cx, cy, size, t){\n      ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)';\n      ctx.lineWidth=1.5; ctx.setLineDash([4,5]);\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(cx - size*2.2, cy + size*1.2);\n      ctx.lineTo(cx - size*0.8, cy + size*0.4);\n      ctx.stroke(); ctx.setLineDash([]);\n\n      const top={x:cx, y:cy-size*1.3};\n      const bot={x:cx, y:cy+size*1.3};\n      const l={x:cx-size*0.9, y:cy-size*0.05};\n      const r={x:cx+size*0.9, y:cy-size*0.05};\n      const f={x:cx, y:cy+size*0.25};\n\n      ctx.fillStyle='#ffffff'; poly([top,l,f]); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle='#e0e0e0'; poly([top,r,f]); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle='#a0a0a0'; poly([bot,l,f]); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle='#707070'; poly([bot,r,f]); ctx.fill();\n\n      ctx.strokeStyle='#ffffff'; ctx.lineWidth=1;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(top.x,top.y); ctx.lineTo(l.x,l.y); ctx.lineTo(bot.x,bot.y); ctx.lineTo(r.x,r.y); ctx.closePath();\n      ctx.moveTo(top.x,top.y); ctx.lineTo(f.x,f.y);\n      ctx.moveTo(bot.x,bot.y); ctx.lineTo(f.x,f.y);\n      ctx.moveTo(l.x,l.y); ctx.lineTo(f.x,f.y);\n      ctx.lineTo(r.x,r.y);\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    const bars = [\n      {x:1,y:8,h:1.2},{x:2,y:8,h:0.6},{x:3,y:7,h:1.8},{x:4,y:7,h:1.1},\n      {x:5,y:6,h:2.2},{x:6,y:6,h:1.4},{x:7,y:6,h:2.6},{x:8,y:5,h:1.9},\n      {x:9,y:5,h:3.0},{x:10,y:4,h:2.4},{x:11,y:4,h:3.4}\n    ];\n\n    function frame(ts){\n      const t = ts*0.001;\n      ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n      const scale = Math.max(W,520)/24;\n      const ox = W*0.5;\n      const oy = H*0.18;\n\n      // Animate flashlights\n      const fl1 = document.getElementById('fl1');\n      const fl2 = document.getElementById('fl2');\n      if(fl1) fl1.style.transform = `translate(${Math.sin(t)*15}%, ${Math.cos(t*0.8)*15}%) scale(${1 + Math.sin(t*1.5)*0.2})`;\n      if(fl2) fl2.style.transform = `translate(${Math.cos(t*1.2)*15}%, ${Math.sin(t*0.9)*15}%)`;\n\n      drawLattice(scale, ox, oy, t);\n\n      const sorted=[...bars].sort((a,b)=>(a.x+a.y)-(b.x+b.y));\n      sorted.forEach(b=> {\n        const animH = b.h + Math.sin(t*2.5 + b.x*0.5 + b.y*0.5)*0.8; \n        block(b.x, b.y, Math.max(0.1, animH), scale, ox, oy);\n      });\n\n      const diamonds=[\n        {bx:W*0.18,by:H*0.50,s:20},\n        {bx:W*0.37,by:H*0.60,s:40},\n        {bx:W*0.55,by:H*0.33,s:35},\n        {bx:W*0.80,by:H*0.58,s:60},\n        {bx:W*0.81,by:H*0.23,s:16}\n      ];\n      \n      diamonds.forEach((dm,i)=>{\n        const fy=Math.sin(t*1.1 + i*1.3)*dm.s*0.18;\n        drawDiamond(dm.bx, dm.by+fy, dm.s, t);\n      });\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "retro-diamonds-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/retro-diamonds-1.jpg", "source_name": "retro-diamonds-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 127, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:43:09.075734+00:00"}